Subject: [PATCH 06/11] test: describe registry defect R-1 as fixed in the
 contract tests

The module docstrings of three contract tests still said that the shared
sqlite3 connection of SQLiteRegistry is unprotected and that the defect is
recorded but not fixed. It is now serialized by an instance-level RLock, with
a regression test in test_registry_hardening.py. Keep the description of the
failure modes and point to the fix.
---
 tests/contract/test_allocation_exclusivity.py | 13 ++++++------
 tests/contract/test_processed_key_store.py    |  6 +++---
 tests/contract/test_registry_consistency.py   | 20 +++++++++----------
 3 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/contract/test_allocation_exclusivity.py b/tests/contract/test_allocation_exclusivity.py
index 90a78ca..3d338d8 100644
--- a/tests/contract/test_allocation_exclusivity.py
+++ b/tests/contract/test_allocation_exclusivity.py
@@ -15,13 +15,12 @@
 同一 DB 文件（多副本部署形态）。唯一索引由 SQLite 在文件写锁串行化下强制执行，
 无论两个 INSERT 如何交错，第二个到达者必然命中索引冲突。
 
-发现的实现缺陷（记录，不在本任务修复）
-----------------------------------------
-**缺陷 R-1（同 test_registry_consistency.py）**：单实例共享连接无锁，并发
-``put_allocation`` 交错时失败方 ``rollback()``（store.py ``IntegrityError``
-处理分支）会连带回滚成功方未提交的 INSERT，出现「两个调用一胜一负，但胜者
-记录丢失 → Active 计数为 0」的静默丢失；本文件并发用例因此采用独立连接形态
-验证唯一索引契约本身。
+缺陷 R-1（已修复，同 test_registry_consistency.py）
+----------------------------------------------------
+修复前单实例共享连接无锁，并发 ``put_allocation`` 交错时失败方 ``rollback()``
+（store.py ``IntegrityError`` 处理分支）会连带回滚成功方未提交的 INSERT，出现
+「两个调用一胜一负，但胜者记录丢失 → Active 计数为 0」的静默丢失。现在共享连接由
+实例级锁串行化；本文件并发用例采用独立连接形态验证唯一索引契约本身。
 """
 
